name                pidgin3
version             2.96.0
revision            0
categories          net
license             GPL-2+
maintainers         {devans @dbevans} openmaintainer
description         Multi-protocol Instant Messaging client
# TODO better description? This sound like peak Y2K advertisement
long_description    Pidgin is an Instant Messenger client that uses GTK+ version 4. \
                    It features multiple groups, group chat, user information \
                    fetching and registration, time stamping, and more.  It \
                    also supports other IM protocols, via included plugins.

homepage            https://www.pidgin.im/
